{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "05a7d31159776565891a526cd40ba0068ffb443b1497ae3a989542c75832354a", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\n珍しい企業のPRに、律子は挑むのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄平面杂志的联动企划。\n律子要挑战为一家少见的企业进行宣传，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "c6881f33ebdae1fdeda931164ca2209ba5c68b8df4b6cf5436d1a679057f6540", "ja": "うう～ん。本当にこの衣装でいいのかなあ。\nやっぱり見せ方でどうにかするしか……。", "zh": "唔……真的穿这身服装没问题吗？\n果然还是只能在呈现方式上下功夫了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fbb3af687c2ed48d6f71d9ac31672b07e3f76b4aa785bf13934ccb1c9f3b5b31", "ja": "お疲れ様、律子。\nどうしたんだ、そんな渋い顔して。", "zh": "辛苦了，律子。\n怎么了，摆出这么严肃的表情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "cee27689c80c181be055c136e350b91b734d939782e5d9ebd6e6848020bfca29", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}……。今日の撮影って、\nあの有名なコンサルタント会社のPRなんですよね？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……今天的拍摄，是给那家知名咨询公司的宣传，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1043e1546fba3c34722751ddeb3d9fb4b2c1f5037427cc9a4ea97020233bda27", "ja": "ああ。「骨太な経営を超絶サポート！」がテーマの\n会社でね。ぜひ知的なイメージのある律子にって。", "zh": "嗯。那家公司以“超强力支持扎实经营！”为主题，所以特意指名了有知性形象的律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "68f3ede2895e770815b650f121f2c15c1e6f3faf3b104d0197a7a55cd684d7b7", "ja": "テーマ的には私にご指名が来るのはわかるんですけど、\nそれでスケルトン、ですか？　……骨太だから？", "zh": "从主题上来说，对方会指名我，我也能理解，\n可这样就要穿骷髅装吗？……因为“骨太”？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9df758ec0a78bd8a1488a77b65ab28e7acff8ad16d47104bdef9a59eae16a642", "ja": "……骨太だから……。先方からインパクトが欲しいと\n言われて、こちらから提案してみたんだけど。", "zh": "……并不是因为骨架大……。对方说希望有冲击力，\n所以这边才提议了这个方案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "47a5fb081c32dbbf926ee80ddef8e041e81ab665d4a91b6fd876d6134a477fd1", "ja": "ま、たしかにインパクトはありますね。とはいえ\n……衣装がちょっとセクシー過ぎないですか？", "zh": "嗯，确实挺有冲击力的。不过……\n这套服装是不是有点太性感了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "952b122bae430fc1c45b91f3c062f20fc26a3f0169af68b247690a95dc05dc7d", "ja": "そうか？　透明感もあって、神秘的で……\n律子によく似合ってて、きれいだと思うけどな。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得既有通透感，又很神秘……很适合律子，也很漂亮啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1009_009rit", "source_sha256": "d6e92f1cab8f987cfa99f01a7e034be3278f5794d13754f3b70d18b91775d0b1", "ja": "うっ……そうストレートに褒められると、\n何も言い返せないじゃないですか……。", "zh": "呃……被你这么直白地夸，我都没法反驳了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "f04f46cfed04d6fd0d001cbe8e2b0e709e7ec8176a6a6eb35ff6bdccf26f4aac", "ja": "でも、本当に大丈夫なんですか？　スケルトンって、\nあんまり知的なイメージもないと思うんですけど。", "zh": "不过，真的没问题吗？我觉得骷髅这种形象，也不太给人聪明的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c769cb0fe3852c9722cb4d944b4b52807ec89c4117024bcec98b8d764cfb7b8b", "ja": "確かに。自我がない形で描かれることが多いよな。\nでも、そこは律子のポテンシャルを活かして……。", "zh": "确实。骷髅大多被描绘成没有自我的形象。\n不过，这方面可以发挥律子的潜力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "65dd01dcbf1b79039c62756eacbd7a3cf71267cf4db0749e56951f2114e54c20", "ja": "もう、適当だなあ……そんなことだと思った。だから\n勝手にいくつか小道具を持ってきてみたんです！", "zh": "真是的，太随便了吧……我就猜到会是这样。所以\n我自己擅自带了一些小道具过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1013_009rit", "source_sha256": "2f4f92a0aeb7324f5c2066fec1b1c44ec2ac2713c5c82296fc3773b5f61d4fbe", "ja": "スケルトンがモチーフのノートに電卓……\n骸骨の形をしたペンに、骨型の伸びる指示棒！", "zh": "以骷髅为主题的笔记本和计算器……\n骷髅形状的笔，还有骨头形状的伸缩指示棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1014_p", "source_sha256": "51da1652822aedd0c4b228678bc81d8135ce9d16a77e7b698637b1ed83cc140b", "ja": "おお、さすが律子。準備がいいな！", "zh": "哦，不愧是律子，准备得真周全啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "8e931f506a846a4c6fb7267125a66553ffa123f228eb96f07748c5f27b597750", "ja": "当然！　常に備えは万全です。先々の見通しを\nクリアーに。さながらスケルトンのように……なんて。", "zh": "那是当然！我的准备随时都是万全的。把未来的前景\n理得清清楚楚。就宛如透明机壳一样……开玩笑的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c83c8c292afd7a35908f3bcfc8b47e2f48f4a5e9d6d02b154eb3663c3186e524", "ja": "本当に頼もしいよ……。その小道具、\n撮影で使えるように、スタッフさんに話しておくよ。", "zh": "真的很可靠啊……那个小道具，我会跟工作人员说一声，让他们看看能不能在拍摄时用上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_009rit0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_009rit0543_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "95d0edcf9bb71401baccd6acc8a5f4376a87ed8c51c4470627aa900f469bdd4b", "ja": "ふふ。まったく、骨が折れるったら。\nじゃあ、行ってきますね。{$P$}！", "zh": "呵呵。真是费劲啊。\n那我先走了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
